 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>你并没有被困住，你只是走错了地方。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无尽的空间？是的。黑暗中潜伏的危险？很不幸，也有。为两个人打造的马桶？绝对有。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >欢迎来到《Failrooms》，这是一款第一人称探索游戏，带你走进阈限空间（liminal spaces）的幕后。准备好沉浸在一个照片级逼真的环境中吧，在这里，对未知的恐惧将与你能想象到的最糟糕的建筑设计决策迎头相撞。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>发现都市传说不想让你看到的一面：</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >令人毛骨悚然的荒谬 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >高质量的画面完全浪费在毫无意义的走廊、天花板上的楼梯和没有水的游泳池上。氛围在尖叫着“危险”，但现实却在尖叫着“无能”。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/5d244ac10a45cd65db24ce38fd00984c.poster.avif?t=1789868673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/5d244ac10a45cd65db24ce38fd00984c.webm?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/5d244ac10a45cd65db24ce38fd00984c.mp4?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >阈限恶搞 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索各种荒谬的版本以及对后室（Backrooms）最具标志性元素的直接致敬，为你最糟糕的噩梦增添一丝喜剧色彩。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4179d82d3582173dbbe89eaf78b3d803.poster.avif?t=1789868673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4179d82d3582173dbbe89eaf78b3d803.webm?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4179d82d3582173dbbe89eaf78b3d803.mp4?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >不要掉以轻心 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >正当你开始嘲笑这糟糕透顶的室内设计时，这个地方就会负责把你脸上的笑容抹去。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4daaff81df4da5251f7247054c180cf6.poster.avif?t=1789868673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4daaff81df4da5251f7247054c180cf6.webm?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4daaff81df4da5251f7247054c180cf6.mp4?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >永远不要相信空荡荡的走廊，也不要相信假门，更不要相信那只橡皮鸭。这个维度喜欢玩弄你的头脑……以及你的神经。你有能力在这场建筑学笑话中幸存下来吗？</p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>你并没有被困住，你只是走错了地方。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无尽的空间？是的。黑暗中潜伏的危险？很不幸，也有。为两个人打造的马桶？绝对有。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >欢迎来到《Failrooms》，这是一款第一人称探索游戏，带你走进阈限空间（liminal spaces）的幕后。准备好沉浸在一个照片级逼真的环境中吧，在这里，对未知的恐惧将与你能想象到的最糟糕的建筑设计决策迎头相撞。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>发现都市传说不想让你看到的一面：</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >令人毛骨悚然的荒谬 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >高质量的画面完全浪费在毫无意义的走廊、天花板上的楼梯和没有水的游泳池上。氛围在尖叫着“危险”，但现实却在尖叫着“无能”。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/5d244ac10a45cd65db24ce38fd00984c.poster.avif?t=1789868673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/5d244ac10a45cd65db24ce38fd00984c.webm?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/5d244ac10a45cd65db24ce38fd00984c.mp4?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >阈限恶搞 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索各种荒谬的版本以及对后室（Backrooms）最具标志性元素的直接致敬，为你最糟糕的噩梦增添一丝喜剧色彩。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4179d82d3582173dbbe89eaf78b3d803.poster.avif?t=1789868673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4179d82d3582173dbbe89eaf78b3d803.webm?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4179d82d3582173dbbe89eaf78b3d803.mp4?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >不要掉以轻心 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >正当你开始嘲笑这糟糕透顶的室内设计时，这个地方就会负责把你脸上的笑容抹去。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4daaff81df4da5251f7247054c180cf6.poster.avif?t=1789868673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4daaff81df4da5251f7247054c180cf6.webm?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4daaff81df4da5251f7247054c180cf6.mp4?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >永远不要相信空荡荡的走廊，也不要相信假门，更不要相信那只橡皮鸭。这个维度喜欢玩弄你的头脑……以及你的神经。你有能力在这场建筑学笑话中幸存下来吗？</p>",
 "short_description": "《Failrooms》是一款恶搞阈限空间的第一人称探索游戏。深入照片级逼真的环境，在这里，对未知的恐惧与你能想象到的最无能的建筑设计迎头相撞。你能在这个维度恶作剧中幸存下来而不发疯吗？",
